{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>For who is a great nation.</b> That has Elohim who is near to it, that answers it continually in all that it asks of Him with wisdom. Also there is no great nation that has righteous statutes and laws balanced in discernment like Israel." "And the meaning of <b>a great nation</b> is on account of the wise of heart, those who fear YHWH."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:22:12.390924935Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}